      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i run a manufacturing plant in ohio and we're getting hit hard by these new carbon emission standards. i have a meeting with our local reps next week and i need to make a strong case for why these specific regulations are bad for mid-sized businesses like mine. can you give me a detailed list of arguments i can use to show the negative economic impact and why these rules are impractical for us?",
